  "types": [
    {
      "name": "Market",
      "docs": [
        "A lending-pool-like market. Suppliers deposit `base_mint` into",
        "`liquidity` and receive `position_mint` 1:1 (a receipt / market position).",
        "The market authority can `borrow` liquidity out, which simulates high",
        "utilisation: position holders then cannot withdraw until it is repaid."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "authority",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "base_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "position_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "borrowed",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "position_mint_bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Vault",
      "docs": [
        "A share-based vault over two assets:",
        "",
        "* `idle`     – ATA of `base_mint` owned by the vault (liquid funds)",
        "* `position` – ATA of `position_mint` owned by the vault (funds deployed",
        "into `market`, represented by the market's 1:1 receipt token)",
        "",
        "Users own the vault through `share_mint` tokens held in their own",
        "wallets. Nobody (including the manager) can move vault assets anywhere",
        "except (a) into/out of the whitelisted market, into the vault's own",
        "accounts, or (b) to a user who burns shares, pro-rata."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "manager",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "market",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "base_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "position_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "share_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "share_mint_bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
